{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992170/extras/f283e419f851591b735c319852dced64.avif?t=1757394523\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span>Step into the labyrinthine world of <strong>Dungeon Run</strong>, where every floor is a test of your strategy. Navigate sprawling mazes, uncover hidden chests, and collect <strong>100 unique keys</strong> to unlock the path to the next floor. <strong>Only the fastest and most cunning adventurers can reach the top!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Floors of Procedural Mazes:</strong> Every run presents a fresh challenge with randomized chest  placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skillful Navigation:</strong> Smooth first-person movement, running, walking, and stamina management. Plan your route carefully to stay ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Key Collection:</strong> Collect keys, buy/sell with other players, and strategize to beat the labyrinth before anyone else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Competition:</strong> Races reset every season, giving everyone a fresh chance to claim the top spots.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you fast enough to conquer the dungeon and claim your place among the champions?</strong> Every decision counts\u2014every second matters. Step in, explore, and race through <strong>Dungeon Run</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992170?t=1757394523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992170/4b18a98c46ef2baabd9145e35036d03b1b908745/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757394523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992170/7af606e6ecbe5848b